/figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貓咪每天都到店裡找老闆擁抱。（圖／攝翻自Facebook@trtafrika）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260522/1134517394975625216508749.jpeg/-bxL0_I1O_WOh8IQJb7dhO-B5jjIA-aLYltcGGJbXBg\"/><figcaption>貓咪每天都到店裡找老闆擁抱。（圖／攝翻自Facebook@trtafrika）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貓咪每天都到店裡找老闆擁抱。（圖／攝翻自Facebook@trtafrika）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260522/1134517397098074112891746.jpeg/SZ3Lv1NSnOQSEzDXuZAGYI7Ka-JQ79qtL6u3Ay-rtwM\"/><figcaption>貓咪每天都到店裡找老闆擁抱。（圖／攝翻自Facebook@trtafrika）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貓咪每天都到店裡找老闆擁抱。（圖／攝翻自Facebook@trtafrika）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260522/1134517387647782912531204.jpeg/qPNBBOg1eKuYHYIg_-uH2brZnAAujXD3uqtJo7qrSaM\"/><figcaption>貓咪每天都到店裡找老闆擁抱。（圖／攝翻自Facebook@trtafrika）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貓咪每天都到店裡找老闆擁抱。（圖／攝翻自Facebook@trtafrika）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260522/1134517390449709056639874.jpeg/RXTPw0tucRe7LHzKiyFHd2WHfUcEzNcOmnd755p3e-c\"/><figcaption>貓咪每天都到店裡找老闆擁抱。（圖／攝翻自Facebook@trtafrika）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貓咪每天都到店裡找老闆擁抱。（圖／攝翻自Facebook@trtafrika）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260522/1134517392932868096015368.jpeg/shG9fizQsV-7nesl2KH0luKmGvh9_xbA8DfxdvA38XY\"/><figcaption>貓咪每天都到店裡找老闆擁抱。（圖／攝翻自Facebook@trtafrika）</figcaption></figure><p>泰伴遊凌晨離奇「4樓墜下亡」　台灣籍同居女友疑涉案被調查</p><p>【本文獲「中天新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-01T05:39:39.460481+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2418,"images":27,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none"}}